Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.51,0:00:45.06,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shout it out kokoro kudakenai youni{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.51,0:00:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shout it out, to save your spirit from breaking{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.52,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nakama ga irun da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your friends are there for you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:53.94,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hora tsuyogari nante iranai itsudatte{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, you don't ever need to act tough{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.03,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}yami ga hikisakou toshitemo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even when the darkness tries to tear you apart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:00:59.33,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hora Brave it out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:00:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come on, brave it out{\i0}
