Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't lose, I'll never run away{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:42.16,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}deai wakare koe ikou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Transcend meetings and partings and keep going{\i0}
